{
 "tts": [
  {
   "out": "gelen/thc/t01/s01_0_NARRATOR.mp3",
   "voice": "Daniel",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The year is 2300. Earth is a memory. Humanity lives in the sky.",
   "vs": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3
   }
  },
  {
   "out": "gelen/thc/t01/s05_0_ASHLEY.mp3",
   "voice": "Matilda",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Where am I? Why can't I remember anything?",
   "vs": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3
   }
  },
  {
   "out": "gelen/thc/t01/s07_0_COMPASS.mp3",
   "voice": "Jessica",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Hello, Twenty-Three. I am Compass. I have waited a long time for you.",
   "vs": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3
   }
  },
  {
   "out": "gelen/thc/t01/s10_0_ASHLEY.mp3",
   "voice": "Matilda",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Twenty-Three? Is that my name?",
   "vs": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3
   }
  },
  {
   "out": "gelen/thc/t01/s11_0_COMPASS.mp3",
   "voice": "Jessica",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Your name is Ashley. And you are the last one awake.",
   "vs": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3
   }
  },
  {
   "out": "gelen/thc/t01/s14_0_ASHLEY.mp3",
   "voice": "Matilda",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Where are the others? There were twenty-three of us!",
   "vs": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3
   }
  },
  {
   "out": "gelen/thc/t01/s17_0_NARRATOR.mp3",
   "voice": "Daniel",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Outside, the world she forgot was waiting.",
   "vs": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3
   }
  },
  {
   "out": "gelen/thc/t01/s20_0_ASHLEY.mp3",
   "voice": "Matilda",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Islands in the sky. This can't be real.",
   "vs": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3
   }
  },
  {
   "out": "gelen/thc/t01/s22_0_KAI.mp3",
   "voice": "Will",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Twenty-Three! If you hear this... the Fortress... help me!",
   "vs": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3
   }
  },
  {
   "out": "gelen/thc/t01/s25_0_ASHLEY.mp3",
   "voice": "Matilda",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "I know that face. I don't know how, but I know him.",
   "vs": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3
   }
  },
  {
   "out": "gelen/thc/t01/s26_0_COMPASS.mp3",
   "voice": "Jessica",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "His signal comes from the Broken Isles. It is dangerous.",
   "vs": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3
   }
  },
  {
   "out": "gelen/thc/t01/s27_0_ASHLEY.mp3",
   "voice": "Matilda",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Then that's where I'm going.",
   "vs": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3
   }
  },
  {
   "out": "gelen/thc/t01/s30_0_NARRATOR.mp3",
   "voice": "Daniel",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "She didn't know who she was. But she knew someone needed her.",
   "vs": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3
   }
  },
  {
   "out": "gelen/thc/t01/s32_0_ASHLEY.mp3",
   "voice": "Matilda",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Hello? Is anyone out here?",
   "vs": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3
   }
  },
  {
   "out": "gelen/thc/t01/s34_0_AVA.mp3",
   "voice": "Laura",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Don't move. Who sent you?",
   "vs": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3
   }
  },
  {
   "out": "gelen/thc/t02/s01_0_NARRATOR.mp3",
   "voice": "Daniel",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The Broken Isles. Where lost things go.",
   "vs": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3
   }
  },
  {
   "out": "gelen/thc/t02/s04_0_ASHLEY.mp3",
   "voice": "Matilda",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Nobody sent me. I'm looking for a friend.",
   "vs": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3
   }
  },
  {
   "out": "gelen/thc/t02/s05_0_AVA.mp3",
   "voice": "Laura",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Friends don't last long out here.",
   "vs": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3
   }
  },
  {
   "out": "gelen/thc/t02/s08_0_AVA.mp3",
   "voice": "Laura",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Leon likes you. That's rare. I'm Ava.",
   "vs": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3
   }
  },
  {
   "out": "gelen/thc/t02/s11_0_RYAN.mp3",
   "voice": "Liam",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Ava! The crystals are singing again! Oh, hi!",
   "vs": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3
   }
  },
  {
   "out": "gelen/thc/t02/s13_0_NARRATOR.mp3",
   "voice": "Daniel",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Ryan was different. The crystals listened to him.",
   "vs": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3
   }
  },
  {
   "out": "gelen/thc/t02/s14_0_ASHLEY.mp3",
   "voice": "Matilda",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "They understand you?",
   "vs": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3
   }
  },
  {
   "out": "gelen/thc/t02/s16_0_RYAN.mp3",
   "voice": "Liam",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Better than grown-ups do.",
   "vs": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3
   }
  },
  {
   "out": "gelen/thc/t02/s17_0_COMPASS.mp3",
   "voice": "Jessica",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Signal detected. Very weak. Coming from the mist.",
   "vs": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3
   }
  },
  {
   "out": "gelen/thc/t02/s22_0_AVA.mp3",
   "voice": "Laura",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Stay close. Things in this mist don't sleep.",
   "vs": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3
   }
  },
  {
   "out": "gelen/thc/t02/s25_0_SHADOW.mp3",
   "voice": "Callum",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Twenty-Three... you finally woke up.",
   "vs": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3
   }
  },
  {
   "out": "gelen/thc/t02/s26_0_ASHLEY.mp3",
   "voice": "Matilda",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "She has my face. Why does she have my face?",
   "vs": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3
   }
  },
  {
   "out": "gelen/thc/t02/s28_0_RYAN.mp3",
   "voice": "Liam",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Okay. That was the creepiest thing ever.",
   "vs": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3
   }
  },
  {
   "out": "gelen/thc/t02/s30_0_COMPASS.mp3",
   "voice": "Jessica",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Ashley. That was not a person. That was a copy.",
   "vs": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3
   }
  },
  {
   "out": "gelen/thc/t02/s32_0_NARRATOR.mp3",
   "voice": "Daniel",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Somewhere far away, someone else was awake too.",
   "vs": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3
   }
  },
  {
   "out": "gelen/thc/t02/s33_0_AVA.mp3",
   "voice": "Laura",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Whoever you are, you're in big trouble.",
   "vs": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3
   }
  },
  {
   "out": "gelen/thc/t03/s01_0_NARRATOR.mp3",
   "voice": "Daniel",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "They hid in the crystal caves. But shadows can follow anywhere.",
   "vs": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3
   }
  },
  {
   "out": "gelen/thc/t03/s04_0_ASHLEY.mp3",
   "voice": "Matilda",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Compass, tell me the truth. What is she?",
   "vs": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3
   }
  },
  {
   "out": "gelen/thc/t03/s05_0_COMPASS.mp3",
   "voice": "Jessica",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "She was the first. Version one. She was never finished.",
   "vs": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3
   }
  },
  {
   "out": "gelen/thc/t03/s07_0_AVA.mp3",
   "voice": "Laura",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "So she's you. Just... broken.",
   "vs": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3
   }
  },
  {
   "out": "gelen/thc/t03/s08_0_ASHLEY.mp3",
   "voice": "Matilda",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "No. Nobody is just broken.",
   "vs": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3
   }
  },
  {
   "out": "gelen/thc/t03/s11_0_SHADOW.mp3",
   "voice": "Callum",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Give me your name, Twenty-Three. You don't deserve it.",
   "vs": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3
   }
  },
  {
   "out": "gelen/thc/t03/s13_0_RYAN.mp3",
   "voice": "Liam",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Hey! Get your own name!",
   "vs": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3
   }
  },
  {
   "out": "gelen/thc/t03/s19_0_AVA.mp3",
   "voice": "Laura",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Run! The tunnel's coming down!",
   "vs": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3
   }
  },
  {
   "out": "gelen/thc/t03/s20_0_NARRATOR.mp3",
   "voice": "Daniel",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "They escaped. But the Shadow had left a clue behind.",
   "vs": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3
   }
  },
  {
   "out": "gelen/thc/t03/s22_0_COMPASS.mp3",
   "voice": "Jessica",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Kai's signal. It comes from the Fortress.",
   "vs": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3
   }
  },
  {
   "out": "gelen/thc/t03/s23_0_ASHLEY.mp3",
   "voice": "Matilda",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Kai. His name is Kai. I remember now.",
   "vs": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3
   }
  },
  {
   "out": "gelen/thc/t03/s26_0_AVA.mp3",
   "voice": "Laura",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Nobody walks into the Fortress and walks out.",
   "vs": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3
   }
  },
  {
   "out": "gelen/thc/t03/s28_0_RYAN.mp3",
   "voice": "Liam",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Leon says we're going anyway.",
   "vs": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3
   }
  },
  {
   "out": "gelen/thc/t03/s31_0_KAEL.mp3",
   "voice": "George",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "If you want to reach the Fortress, you'll need me.",
   "vs": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3
   }
  },
  {
   "out": "gelen/thc/t03/s32_0_NARRATOR.mp3",
   "voice": "Daniel",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The old man had a name. And a secret.",
   "vs": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3
   }
  },
  {
   "out": "gelen/thc/t04/s01_0_NARRATOR.mp3",
   "voice": "Daniel",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "His name was Kael. The last guardian.",
   "vs": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3
   }
  },
  {
   "out": "gelen/thc/t04/s02_0_KAEL.mp3",
   "voice": "George",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Sit. You're safe here. For tonight.",
   "vs": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3
   }
  },
  {
   "out": "gelen/thc/t04/s05_0_RYAN.mp3",
   "voice": "Liam",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Is this from Earth? The real Earth?",
   "vs": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3
   }
  },
  {
   "out": "gelen/thc/t04/s07_0_KAEL.mp3",
   "voice": "George",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "I was a boy in 2099. I saw it end.",
   "vs": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3
   }
  },
  {
   "out": "gelen/thc/t04/s08_0_NARRATOR.mp3",
   "voice": "Daniel",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Earth was dying. A few people escaped to build Elyra in the sky.",
   "vs": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3
   }
  },
  {
   "out": "gelen/thc/t04/s11_0_ASHLEY.mp3",
   "voice": "Matilda",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "And the capsules? Why were we sleeping?",
   "vs": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3
   }
  },
  {
   "out": "gelen/thc/t04/s13_0_KAEL.mp3",
   "voice": "George",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "You twenty-three were Earth's last hope.",
   "vs": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3
   }
  },
  {
   "out": "gelen/thc/t04/s14_0_KAEL.mp3",
   "voice": "George",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The other twenty-two still sleep beneath the Fortress.",
   "vs": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3
   }
  },
  {
   "out": "gelen/thc/t04/s16_0_AVA.mp3",
   "voice": "Laura",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Then Sila is keeping them prisoner.",
   "vs": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3
   }
  },
  {
   "out": "gelen/thc/t04/s17_0_NARRATOR.mp3",
   "voice": "Daniel",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Sila. Commander of the Shadow. She wanted Elyra for herself.",
   "vs": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3
   }
  },
  {
   "out": "gelen/thc/t04/s20_0_KAEL.mp3",
   "voice": "George",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "This opens any door. And any mind.",
   "vs": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3
   }
  },
  {
   "out": "gelen/thc/t04/s23_0_ASHLEY.mp3",
   "voice": "Matilda",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Then we go tomorrow. All of us.",
   "vs": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3
   }
  },
  {
   "out": "gelen/thc/t04/s26_0_NARRATOR.mp3",
   "voice": "Daniel",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "For one night, they were almost a family.",
   "vs": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3
   }
  },
  {
   "out": "gelen/thc/t04/s30_0_SHADOW.mp3",
   "voice": "Callum",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Tomorrow, Twenty-Three. Tomorrow I become you.",
   "vs": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3
   }
  },
  {
   "out": "gelen/thc/t04/s32_0_NARRATOR.mp3",
   "voice": "Daniel",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The Fortress was waiting.",
   "vs": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3
   }
  },
  {
   "out": "gelen/thc/t05/s01_0_NARRATOR.mp3",
   "voice": "Daniel",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The Fortress. Nobody had ever broken in.",
   "vs": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3
   }
  },
  {
   "out": "gelen/thc/t05/s04_0_KAEL.mp3",
   "voice": "George",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The guards are made of crystal. Ryan, it's your turn.",
   "vs": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3
   }
  },
  {
   "out": "gelen/thc/t05/s07_0_RYAN.mp3",
   "voice": "Liam",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Okay. No pressure. Just sing to the giant scary robots.",
   "vs": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3
   }
  },
  {
   "out": "gelen/thc/t05/s10_0_NARRATOR.mp3",
   "voice": "Daniel",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Ryan's song made the guards dream. Just for a moment.",
   "vs": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3
   }
  },
  {
   "out": "gelen/thc/t05/s13_0_ASHLEY.mp3",
   "voice": "Matilda",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Kai! Kai, it's me! It's Twenty-Three!",
   "vs": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3
   }
  },
  {
   "out": "gelen/thc/t05/s16_0_KAI.mp3",
   "voice": "Will",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Who are you? I don't know you.",
   "vs": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3
   }
  },
  {
   "out": "gelen/thc/t05/s17_0_NARRATOR.mp3",
   "voice": "Daniel",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "They had taken his memories. All of them.",
   "vs": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3
   }
  },
  {
   "out": "gelen/thc/t05/s19_0_SILA.mp3",
   "voice": "Lily",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "How touching. He doesn't remember you, girl.",
   "vs": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3
   }
  },
  {
   "out": "gelen/thc/t05/s20_0_AVA.mp3",
   "voice": "Laura",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Ashley, we need to go. Now!",
   "vs": {
    "stability": 0.45,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3
   }
  },
  {
   "out": "gelen/thc/t05/s28_0_NARRATOR.mp3",
